  "description": "This Texture Change The Minecraft Tools to 3D",
  "body": "<br>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b271ddcd95089e93ebf7b705fe51f2713abf00a6.png\"\n    alt=\"Better 3D Tools\"\n    width=\"600\">\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<hr>\n\n<br>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/17aeebc13d1a3219e7e518d7a7f22a49446d7a4a_0.webp\"\n    alt=\"Description\"\n    width=\"300\">\n</p>\n\n# What have in the texturepack\n\n- 3D Swords\n- Bow ( that was inspired in GugerOS )\n- Crossbow\n- Trident\n- Diamond Pickaxe( I'm testing the Model )\n- Arrow\n- Firework\n- Multshot Crossbow\n- Multshot Bow\n\n<h1></h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e89131022b7eefbf4f3dc0ccd7bf1d30485ea4e9.jpeg\"\n    alt=\"Diamond Sword\"\n    style=\"max-width:100%; height:auto;\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a75a24380728bbda1f3c661c66c91b5a3b29426e.jpeg\"\n    alt=\"Multshot Arrow Crossbow\"\n    style=\"max-width:100%; height:auto;\">\n</p>\n\n<h1></h1>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e812fd6e67e9eac3c00ba2bf16df1830cef91c82.png\"\n    alt=\"REQUIREMENTS\"\n    width=\"320\">\n\n<p>This pack requires <strong>Optifine</strong> or <strong>Entity Model Features</strong> Fabric 1.21.X, Forge 1.21.X.</p>\n  \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/entity-model-features\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KssS6VT.png\" width=\"100\" alt=\"EMF\">\n  </a>\n  \n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<hr>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a84a822e69f5e42576ea0631129332b714a27a0a_0.webp\"\n    alt=\"LINKS\"\n    width=\"170\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-3d-tools\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fimages-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com%2Ff